      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Tell us your appliances and what batteries you have now, and an independent installer will quote the inverter, battery bank and protection in writing. Call now and ask for two or three comparable quotes.</p>
